#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod di halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami syorkan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"You can use options to customize the Executor primitive. Unlike Sampler and Estimator, Executor has very few options since the majority of the design intents is encoded in the samplex.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can see the available options and update option values during or after primitive initialization.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh melihat pilihan yang tersedia dan mengemaskini nilai pilihan semasa atau selepas permulaan primitif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `update()` method to apply changes to the `options` attribute.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan kaedah `update()` untuk menerapkan perubahan kepada atribut `options`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
msgstr "- Atribut `options` adalah jenis Python `dataclass`. Anda boleh menggunakan kaedah `asdict` terbina dalam untuk menukarnya kepada kamus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Executor can only process information encoded in samplexes. Refer to the [Samplomatic guides](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/guides/index) to understand restrictions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Executor hanya boleh memproses maklumat yang dikodkan dalam samplex. Rujuk [panduan Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/guides/index) untuk memahami sekatan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"pass-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Executor options {#set-executor-options}"
msgstr "Tetapkan pilihan Executor {#set-executor-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an option is specified both during and after primitive initialization, the value set after initializing the primitive is used.\n"
msgstr "Jika pilihan ditentukan semasa dan selepas permulaan primitif, nilai yang ditetapkan selepas memulakan primitif digunakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Primitive initialization {#primitive-initialization}"
msgstr "Permulaan primitif {#primitive-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can pass in an instance of the options class or a dictionary when initializing Executor, which then makes a copy of those options. Thus, changing the original dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the options owned by the primitive.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menghantar instans kelas pilihan atau kamus apabila memulakan Executor, yang kemudian membuat salinan pilihan tersebut. Oleh itu, menukar kamus asal atau instans pilihan tidak mempengaruhi pilihan yang dimiliki oleh primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options class {#options-class}"
msgstr "Kelas pilihan {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When creating an instance of the `Executor` class, you can pass in an instance of the options class. Those options are then applied when you use `run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: `options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"
msgstr "Apabila mencipta instans kelas `Executor`, anda boleh menghantar instans kelas pilihan. Pilihan-pilihan tersebut kemudian diterapkan apabila anda menggunakan `run()` untuk melakukan pengiraan. Tentukan pilihan dalam format ini: `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`. Sebagai contoh: `options.environment.log_level = INFO`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Kamus {#dictionary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify options as a dictionary when initializing Executor.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menentukan pilihan sebagai kamus apabila memulakan Executor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-table\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-table\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available options {#available-options}"
msgstr "Pilihan yang tersedia {#available-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table documents options from the latest version of `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. To see older option versions, visit the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) and select a previous version.\n"
msgstr "Jadual berikut mendokumentasikan pilihan dari versi terbaru `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Untuk melihat versi pilihan yang lebih lama, layari [rujukan API `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) dan pilih versi sebelumnya.\n"

